+STRUCTURED_MEMORIES:
+  description: >
+    Experimental. Space-separated list of register-file spec files, one
+    per RTL module to replace with a generated, placed standard-cell
+    macro rather than synthesise to flops. Each spec names its module,
+    words, bits, read and write ports by the RTL's own port names, and
+    the cells; the generator checks the spec against the module's ports,
+    writes `<module>.lef`, `<module>.lib` and `<module>_pre_layout.lib`
+    under `$(RESULTS_DIR)/memories/`, and the module is blackboxed like
+    an AUTO_MEMORIES macro. Explicit by design: nothing is detected.
+    Requires AUTO_MEMORIES=1 and STRUCTURED_GEN.
+  stages:
+    - synth
+STRUCTURED_GEN:
+  description: >
+    Path of the generator STRUCTURED_MEMORIES runs. Set by the build
+    system that carries the generator, not by a design.
+  stages:
+    - synth
